# nzhs-employee-metrics
## What needs to be achieved?
- Visibility of user behaviour
  + Integration into pipedrive
  + Tracking where users get to in the quote flow
  + Tracking what pages users visit
  + Tracking user behaviour

## What questions do I have?
- What exact information do we need?
- Is any of this information more important?
- Who will view this information?
- What information will impact conversion to bookings?

## What tools do we have available?
- Mailchimp
  + Do we have tracking enabled?
- Employer portal tracking in a PR (should be copyable to the employee portal)
- Posthog, set up but barely used
- Quote flow step stored on quote requests
  + Which solutions have been selected?
  + Which step did they get to?
  + Did they make it to the quote?
- Provisional quote stores status
  +  video_survey_booked, technical_survey_booked, installed

## Pipedrive-centrism
- Pipedrive looks to be the most useful thing here
- Just "New In", and "Quoting"
- Each deal is ONE quote request owner
- Each deal shows all solutions and the furthest step/stage that has been reached
- NOT lead quoter requests, just employee quote requests

